<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<%- include('../partials/_head.ejs', { 
  title: '배너 이미지 관리',
  description: `
  - 배너 이미지 관리 시스템입니다.
  - 외부 링크로 이동하는 배너는 자유롭게 추가 등록이 가능합니다.
  - 그 외에 국민DR,플러스DR,가이드는 배너가 고정이며 최대 1개씩만 등록 가능합니다.
  - 배너 순서는 드래그하여 변경할 수 있습니다.
  `,
}) %>
<body data-controller="modal">
  <div class="flex h-screen">
    <%- include('../partials/_sidebar.ejs', { activePage: 'banners' }) %>
    <main class="w-full h-full p-10 page-animation-enter" style="min-width: 800px; max-width: 800px;">
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800">
          배너 이미지 관리
        </h1>
        <!-- 배너 이미지 등록 버튼 -->
        <a href="/admin/banners/new" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 p-3 bg-blue-900 text-white rounded-xl" style="width: 170px;">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15" />
          </svg>
          <span class="text-sm">
            배너 이미지 등록
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 순서 변경 안내 메시지 -->
      <% if (banners && banners.length > 1) { %>
      <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 rounded-md">
        <div class="flex items-center text-xs">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
          배너를 드래그하여 순서를 변경할 수 있습니다. 
          <div class="flex items-center ml-2 text-xs text-gray-500">(
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 16V4m0 0L3 8m4-4l4 4m6 0v12m0 0l4-4m-4 4l-4-4" />
            </svg>
            아이콘을 드래그하여 순서를 변경하세요.
            )
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <% } %>

      <!-- 배너 이미지 리스트 - 한 줄에 2개씩 표시 -->
      <div class="mt-6" 
        data-controller="drag-drop"
        data-drag-drop-url-value="/admin/banners/update-order"
        data-drag-drop-order-badge-selector-value=".order-badge"
        data-drag-drop-confirmation-delay-value="3000">

        <!-- 확인 UI - 기본적으로 숨김 -->
        <div 
          class="fixed bottom-5 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 bg-white shadow-lg rounded-lg p-4 w-96 hidden z-50"
          data-drag-drop-target="confirmationBar">
          <div class="flex justify-between mb-2">
            <span class="font-semibold text-gray-700">순서 변경 적용 중...</span>
            <button 
              class="text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-800"
              data-action="drag-drop#cancelUpdate">
              취소
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="h-2 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
            <div 
              class="h-full bg-blue-600 rounded-full"
              data-drag-drop-target="progressBar"
              style="width: 0%;"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 text-center delay-text">
            3초 후 자동으로 적용됩니다. 취소하려면 '취소' 버튼을 클릭하세요.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 배너 목록 -->
        <div 
          class="flex flex-wrap gap-6" 
          data-drag-drop-target="container">
          <% if (banners && banners.length > 0) { %>
            <% banners.forEach((banner) => { %>
              <!-- 배너 이미지 아이템 -->
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-2" data-drag-drop-target="item" data-id="<%= banner.id %>" style="width:calc(50% - 12px); max-width: 400px;">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                  <div class="flex items-center">
                    <!-- 드래그 핸들 -->
                    <div class="drag-handle cursor-move p-1 mr-1 text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700">
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 16V4m0 0L3 8m4-4l4 4m6 0v12m0 0l4-4m-4 4l-4-4" />
                      </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="bg-gray-500 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded-lg flex-shrink-0 order-badge"><%= banner.displayOrder %></span>
                    <span class="<%= actionTypeColors[banner.actionType] %> text-white text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-lg flex-shrink-0 ml-1">
                      <%= actionTypeLabels[banner.actionType] %>
                    </span>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <a href="/admin/banners/edit/<%= banner.id %>" class="text-yellow-500">수정</a>
                    <a 
                      href="/admin/banners/destroy/<%= banner.id %>" 
                      class="text-red-500"
                      data-id="<%= banner.id %>"
                      data-banner-type="<%= actionTypeLabels[banner.actionType] %>"
                      data-action="click->modal#open"
                      data-turbo="false">삭제</a>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-300">
                  <img src="<%= banner.imageUrl %>" class="block w-full"/>
                </div>
              </div>
            <% }); %>
          <% } else { %>
            <div class="w-full text-center py-10 text-gray-500">
              등록된 배너가 없습니다.
            </div>
          <% } %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
  
  <!-- 삭제 확인 모달 -->
  <%- include('./_delete-modal.ejs') %>
</body>
</html>